// Find: the nearest match of needle (code points) from from, forward, or backward with ed_f_back in flags; ed_f_case in flags matches case. Answers 1 and writes the start of the match into spot, or answers 0. A match lies in one paragraph, and an empty needle matches nothing. To wrap around, the caller searches again from the start (or end) of the document.
find_next(Doc d, Pos from, int[] needle, int flags, Pos spot) {
  int res = 0;
  if(len(needle) > 0) {
    res = find_scan(d, from, needle, flags, spot);
  }
} return int res;
given fx_setup("one two one") given fx_hit(9, 9) ((import fxd), Pos(0, 1), [111, 110, 101], 0, (import fxh)):(1) then fx_hit_str:("0:8")
